WEBVTT

00:09:58.676 --> 00:10:01.716
There's power there, there's value there.
There's beauty there.

00:10:03.396 --> 00:10:06.596
Shame-work is social work --

00:10:06.596 --> 00:10:08.196
it's time we all did a bit.

00:10:09.516 --> 00:10:12.876
These days, I find it easy
to look in the mirror.

00:10:13.876 --> 00:10:16.796
Thank you for coming to my TED talk.